er changers entering the cybersecurity field and want a specialized niche</span></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"bg-light-bg py-20 px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><p class=\"section-label mb-3\">// CURRICULUM</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-navy text-3xl font-bold mb-2\">Full Course Curriculum</h2><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray\">Click any module to see the lessons inside.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 border-divider bg-white\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal focus:ring-inset transition-colors hover:bg-light-bg\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 min-w-0\"><span class=\"font-display text-xs font-bold w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-navy text-teal-lt\">00</span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold leading-tight\">Welcome &amp; Orientation</h3><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-xs mt-0.5\">20 min</p></div></div><span class=\"text-teal-lt text-lg shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 \" aria-hidden=\"true\">▾</span></button></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 border-divider bg-white\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal focus:ring-inset transition-colors hover:bg-light-bg\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 min-w-0\"><span class=\"font-display text-xs font-bold w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-navy text-teal-lt\">01</span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold leading-tight\">The AI Risk Landscape</h3><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-xs mt-0.5\">45 min</p></div></div><span class=\"text-teal-lt text-l